CHAPTER.VERS:
but don't you

          {+}
         stop; pursue after your

          {+}
         enemies, and strike the hindmost of them; don't allow them to enter into their cities: for Yahweh your

          {+}
         God has delivered them into your

          {+}
         hand.

And it came to pass, when they brought forth those kings to Joshua, that Joshua called for all the men of Israel, and said to the chiefs of the men of war that went with him, Come near, put your

          {+}
         feet on the necks of these kings. And they came near, and put their feet on the necks of them.

And Joshua said to them, Don't be afraid, nor be dismayed; be strong and of good courage: for thus will Yahweh do to all your

          {+}
         enemies against whom you

          {+}
         fight.
